  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Because (two forms)",
     "texto": [
      "**For** (because) takes main clause word order. **Fordi** (because) takes subordinate word order.",
      "Example: **Jeg blev hjemme, for jeg var ikke rask.** = I stayed at home, because I wasn't well.",
      "Example: **Jeg blev hjemme, fordi jeg ikke var rask.** = I stayed at home because I wasn't well."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "So, and so… that",
     "texto": [
      "**Så** (so) joins two main clauses: **Det regnede, så vi blev hjemme.** = It was raining, so we stayed at home.",
      "**Så… at** (so… that) shows a consequence and takes subordinate word order: **Han er så træt, at han ikke kan arbejde.** = He's so tired that he can't work."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
